AG-UI conformance stream fixtures
=================================

The three *.json files in this directory are vendored, unmodified, from the
upstream AG-UI protocol repository. CAO's Dojo trace tests run them through
the same lifecycle check they apply to CAO's own recorded frames, to prove the
check can fail (see test/examples/test_cao_dojo_trace_replay.py and
examples/ag-ui/ag-ui-stock-client-live/verify-trace.mjs).

Source project : AG-UI protocol
Source URL     : https://github.com/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui
Source commit  : 08eae9dc13546e91272efb2d0ef863e21acc6ee3
Upstream path  : spec/1.0/conformance/streams/
License        : MIT (the upstream LICENSE file, reproduced verbatim beside
                 this NOTICE)

Vendored files:
  - first-event-not-run-started-fatal.json
  - nested-run-started-fatal.json
  - run-finished-interrupt-outcome-accepted.json

PIN.json records the sha256 of every vendored file and of LICENSE; a test
fails if any byte changes. To refresh, copy the files from a newer upstream
commit, then update the commit and hashes in PIN.json in the same change.
